    <headline>ALERT: immunisation coverage falling in Serere District</headline>
    <description>Three-month Penta1 coverage is 65%; about 3,933 children in the last 12 months have received no Penta1 dose. Trigger: coverage falling below district baseline (CUSUM 26.5). SIMULATED DATA - EXERCISE.</description>
    <instruction>District Health Team to verify vaccine stock and session reports, and plan catch-up outreach for unreached parishes.</instruction>
